 "evidence": "sources/1107-news-5.txt", "original_text_archive": "sources/1107-news-5.txt"}], "company_news": [{"title": "中国石油进博会采购签约超188亿美元", "text": "与35家伙伴签署38份采购协议，来源覆盖16个国家和地区，涉及油气资源、高端装备、绿色低碳等领域，签约金额较去年稳中有升。", "source": "新华网", "published": "2026-11-06", "event_date": "2026-11-06", "url": "https://www.news.cn/energy/20261106/3f5ec34e6c73431d85664c98c83d60a6/c.html", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-09T16:25:40.857709+08:00", "evidence": "sources/1107-news-4.txt", "original_text_archive": "sources/1107-news-4.txt"}, {"title": "法国能源公司 TotalEnergies 扩大 LNG 长协布局", "text": "与阿联酋天然气公司 ADNOC Gas 签署五年合计最多160万吨供气协议；另与江苏国信签署15年、每年90万吨采购框架协议，拟2028年起供，尚待最终购销协议。", "source": "Offshore Energy", "published": "2026-11-06", "event_date": null, "url": "https://www.offshore-energy.biz/2026/11/06/totalenergies-locks-in-lng-supply-from-adnoc-and-offtake-deal-with-chinese-firm", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-09T16:25:40.961801+08:00", "evidence": "sources/1107-news-3.txt", "original_text_archive": "sources/1107-news-3.txt"}, {"title": "四家油气公司联合开发马来西亚气田", "text": "泰国油气公司 PTTEP、法国能源公司 TotalEnergies、科威特勘探公司 KUFPEC 与马来西亚国家石油公司 Petronas 签署权益转让协议，拟协同开发资源量超6.5万亿立方英尺的气田，尚待监管批准。", "source": "Offshore Energy", "published": "2026-11-06", "event_date": null, "url": "https://www.offshore-energy.biz/2026/11/06/oil-and-gas-quartet-partners-up-to-unlock-over-65-trillion-cubic-feet-of-asian-gas", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-09T16:25:40.547195+08:00", "evidence": "sources/1107-news-1.txt", "original_text_archive": "sources/1107-news-1.txt"}, {"title": "美国 LNG 公司 Venture Global 推进 CP2 扩建", "text": "澳大利亚工程公司 Worley 获得扩建项目工程、采购和施工合同。Venture Global 计划2027年初作出最终投资决定，目前尚未完成该决定。", "source": "Offshore Energy", "published": "2026-11-06", "event_date": null, "url": "https://www.offshore-energy.biz/2026/11/06/worley-on-epc-duty-at-venture-globals-us-lng-expansion-project", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-09T16:25:40.612355+08:00", "evidence": "sources/1107-news-2.txt", "original_text_archive": "sources/1107-news-2.txt"}, {"title": "菲律